WEBVTT

00:42.852 --> 00:52.456
The engine hums, a steady beat 30,000 tired feet

00:53.217 --> 00:59.199
Above the clouds, a sea of white Escaping from

00:59.359 --> 01:06.550
the endless night Your hand in mine A steady

01:06.670 --> 01:14.373
grace The only anchor in this place You let me

01:14.473 --> 01:21.855
lean against your side With nothing left to run

01:22.135 --> 01:24.536
or hide

01:27.117 --> 01:33.679
And for the first time in so long I can breathe

01:38.398 --> 01:41.720
A quiet promise,

01:42.501 --> 01:48.405
I believe

01:48.445 --> 01:52.408
Your shoulder is my only home right now A silent,

01:52.468 --> 01:56.831
true and sacred vow A sanctuary in the sky

01:56.871 --> 02:00.813
Beneath the calm and endless sky Is all I need to

02:00.893 --> 02:07.498
feel okay And chase the lingering fog away

02:10.576 --> 02:17.920
I think about the static sound On that unholy,

02:18.160 --> 02:26.165
hollow ground I think about the pouring rain The

02:26.265 --> 02:33.048
endless fear, the burning pain But then I feel

02:33.449 --> 02:41.475
you squeeze my hand And I begin to understand The

02:41.575 --> 02:48.981
storm has passed, the war is done A quiet battle

02:49.121 --> 02:50.882
has been won

02:54.886 --> 03:01.211
And for the first time in so long I can breathe

03:05.920 --> 03:08.361
A quiet promise,

03:10.222 --> 03:16.144
I believe

03:16.184 --> 03:20.145
Your shoulder is my only home right now A silent,

03:20.205 --> 03:24.567
true, and sacred vow This sanctuary in the sky

03:24.587 --> 03:28.509
Beneath a calm and endless eye Is all I need to

03:28.609 --> 03:34.631
feel okay And chase the lingering fog away

04:13.085 --> 04:13.508
Shhh.

05:12.903 --> 05:13.214
Safe.

